# Run artifacts. These land in the repo root because that is the working dir
# slurm jobs are submitted from; none of it belongs in git. wandb/ especially:
# it is where every run's local state accumulates, so an unguarded `git add -A`
# would sweep hundreds of MB of run data into a commit.
wandb/
nohup_*/
norm_stats_cache/
slurm-*.out
ss/
/*.png
